[{:db/id "q-49404/selection/616281d29e64d227af60bd0507e3916042c310a89d20e61700f040ef9d527f05" :answer/id #uuid "cc159f6d-d5a9-5271-aaf6-ecec47b452fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-4|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49404/selection/43bca3e7d988d1118b0e10731666d95cd022dbae90d955b326d70857a6a68b3f" :answer/id #uuid "b9f73465-12f9-54bb-9b1f-951bde5354fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-4|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49404/selection/489c596055169c9fcab9b16bf8ab6d106c962fe09a8959292a6e9fd09208f78c" :answer/id #uuid "73c1b4b2-a28d-52e3-9ad0-dfc0fef5e959" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+7\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-4|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49404/selection/7b942312f875926a6f38e955f67f804d7e9d37b8e2e1683844aec2048ad54f4d" :answer/id #uuid "3cfac6be-6ca6-52fe-9829-e171e5e3356e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-4|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49404/selection/56cef0546a635b9c7bfc4c97a554ee6818a8d709be1737327c5360da0fba02af" :answer/id #uuid "d930ceeb-c9bd-5095-9fc0-024166487bbb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-4\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-4|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49404/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "44395535-a76b-5c25-844b-25b0e90ae2da" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49404/selection/489c596055169c9fcab9b16bf8ab6d106c962fe09a8959292a6e9fd09208f78c" :answer-field/choices ["q-49404/selection/616281d29e64d227af60bd0507e3916042c310a89d20e61700f040ef9d527f05" "q-49404/selection/43bca3e7d988d1118b0e10731666d95cd022dbae90d955b326d70857a6a68b3f" "q-49404/selection/489c596055169c9fcab9b16bf8ab6d106c962fe09a8959292a6e9fd09208f78c" "q-49404/selection/7b942312f875926a6f38e955f67f804d7e9d37b8e2e1683844aec2048ad54f4d" "q-49404/selection/56cef0546a635b9c7bfc4c97a554ee6818a8d709be1737327c5360da0fba02af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49404" :question/id #uuid "5d0aa088-8659-5147-af8c-f3e690e90bb6" :question/math-academy-id "q-49404" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{x+3}{x-4}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator of the integrand doesn't divide the numerator exactly, so we need to decompose it into its quotient and remainder. For this, we can use synthetic division.\n\nWe start by drawing up our synthetic division table:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & x & {x}^{0} \\\\ 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\  & ↓ & 4 \\\\  & 1 & 7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\frac{x+3}{x-4}=1+\\frac{7}{x-4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{x+3}{x-4}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1+\\frac{7}{x-4})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\text{d}x+7\\int \\frac{1}{x-4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x+7\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-4|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-49404/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "236f51c2-22ad-551f-afb4-62fd6de6d21e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49404"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-352216/field-1/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer/id #uuid "f1b573f4-6bae-5027-9d0d-b8e68db20675" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-352216/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "4932558f-8cba-51b5-9103-a164a6b96baf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-352216/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc72520c-b6e5-56cb-ba39-46564ef3aa31" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-352216/field-1/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer-field/choices ["q-352216/field-1/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" "q-352216/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-352216/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "283bc39d-2c97-579f-947b-fc46b5877a67" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-352216/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "4dd706bb-8b45-5779-99a3-859e22dd8650" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-352216/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-352216/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-352216" :question/id #uuid "40821fd7-459c-5f1a-b598-66814fd41eb8" :question/math-academy-id "q-352216" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral:\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{7x+4}{x+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$ \n{{field-1}} $-\\,3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(${{field-2}}$)$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator of the integrand doesn't divide the numerator exactly, so we need to decompose it into its quotient and remainder. For this, we can use synthetic division.\n\nWe start by drawing up our synthetic division table:\n\n|  | ${x}^{1}$ | ${x}^{0}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $-1$ | $7$ | $4$ |\n|  | $↓$ | $-7$ |\n|  | $7$ | $-3$ |\n\nSo, from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\frac{7x+4}{x+1}=7-\\frac{3}{x+1}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{7x+4}{x+1}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(7-\\frac{3}{x+1})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =7{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\text{d}x-3{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{x+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =7x\\,{|}_{0}^{2}-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+1|\\,{|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =7(2-0)-3(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2+1|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|0+1|) \\\\  & =14-3(\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1) \\\\  & =14-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\,3\\,).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-352216/field-1" "q-352216/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "236f51c2-22ad-551f-afb4-62fd6de6d21e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-352216"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49353/selection/bbd19215aa3aea53bc9b223673ee24a6efe765e95f8d63b0ff3f4927a5202c1a" :answer/id #uuid "7ab79d01-9573-54f3-be11-bf963846b25d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49353/selection/d310c1f9723c00c61561ed0ceb7bdff9a03157cbb1fdea74ee08ec270b0276fd" :answer/id #uuid "c14eeb30-48b1-5164-ad1a-91805dff0bbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49353/selection/fb8e754ca1802c4799aea72d4990a96ce979a700d9d6ffa07f4ad93bf1ae2ed2" :answer/id #uuid "1d99632e-994b-5695-b0aa-7e0158559c4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49353/selection/da5694eb50a1f1fab6f1fb924dc6e6d697cdd2aa9940fb3ba4e10cde53746f40" :answer/id #uuid "c067cf5b-0286-5c6c-b102-8e02634c4b3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49353/selection/abe90e158fc2dc52607cfeb0f773ddabcd92aad78e5f635b2a1abbc2c5ab1f1f" :answer/id #uuid "a3a30f90-4032-5a5d-84d8-8d99dd2e794e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49353/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b26ab68d-a2a4-508c-a468-e0734cd5550c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49353/selection/fb8e754ca1802c4799aea72d4990a96ce979a700d9d6ffa07f4ad93bf1ae2ed2" :answer-field/choices ["q-49353/selection/bbd19215aa3aea53bc9b223673ee24a6efe765e95f8d63b0ff3f4927a5202c1a" "q-49353/selection/d310c1f9723c00c61561ed0ceb7bdff9a03157cbb1fdea74ee08ec270b0276fd" "q-49353/selection/fb8e754ca1802c4799aea72d4990a96ce979a700d9d6ffa07f4ad93bf1ae2ed2" "q-49353/selection/da5694eb50a1f1fab6f1fb924dc6e6d697cdd2aa9940fb3ba4e10cde53746f40" "q-49353/selection/abe90e158fc2dc52607cfeb0f773ddabcd92aad78e5f635b2a1abbc2c5ab1f1f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49353" :question/id #uuid "fdc1997e-1bad-55a9-b760-1b70db782f65" :question/math-academy-id "q-49353" :question/problem "Evaluate ${\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{2x-3}{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator of the integrand doesn't divide the numerator exactly, so we need to decompose it into its quotient and remainder. For this, we can use synthetic division.\n\nWe start by drawing up our synthetic division table:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & x & {x}^{0} \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\  & ↓ & 2 \\\\  & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\frac{2x-3}{x-1}=2-\\frac{1}{x-1}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{2x-3}{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}(2-\\frac{1}{x-1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}2\\,\\text{d}x-{\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{1}{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2x{|}_{2}^{3}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-1|{|}_{2}^{3} \\\\  & =2(3-2)-(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3-1|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2-1|) \\\\  & =2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-49353/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "236f51c2-22ad-551f-afb4-62fd6de6d21e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49353"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49354/selection/5a084ff3831260c196c22bc24183f53183553d555cc94f58faac01ec34c59996" :answer/id #uuid "6aec6078-01a4-5b59-93d5-68b741df2d28" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+2|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49354/selection/fa8d3671c5b1c98c7ad37c2ea6a43d8bbf91e31228b2fe075958347cd049b884" :answer/id #uuid "3e35a6e5-4